WEBVTT

NOTE Explanatory visual descriptions, not a speech transcript.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Lost & Found for music festivals.
An RFID locker built around Arduino.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The master card starts registration.
The LCD shows Master Mode On.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Scan the item's RFID tag.
The LCD prompts Register Item.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Staff enter a description using
the Arduino Serial Monitor.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Place the wallet inside the locker.
The door is open for storage.

6
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Close the locker door.
Closure shown from the keys take.

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:34.000
A matching personal tag lights green.
The demonstrator opens the door.

8
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:39.000
An unknown tag is scanned.
The LCD responds Access Denied.

9
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.500
Arduino, breadboard and wiring.
One sketch connects the components.

